      "entries": [
        "The nightmarchers fling a hail of spears and stones, dealing 5d6+9 bludgeoning or piercing damage to creatures in a 10-foot burst within 20 feet (DC 31 basic Reflex save). When the nightmarchers are reduced to 8 or fewer squares, this decreases to a 5-foot burst. Striking Koa 1 to 3 Frequency once per round; The troop attacks with spears, clubs, and leiomano against enemies within 5 feet (DC 33 basic Reflex save) for their choice of bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage depending on the number of actions. 1 2d6+2 slashing damage 2 4d6+12 slashing damage 3 6d6+12 slashing damage."
      ],
